wienerlabs/aperture — Copyright (c) 2026 Makinci — MIT

  circuits/payment.circom
      The compliance circuit, ported from aperture's Solana circuit and
      reparameterised for EVM addresses.
  services/prover/src/hash.js
      Ported directly; the hashing has to agree with the circuit byte for byte.
  services/prover/src/openapi.js
      Inherited, then corrected where the spec had drifted from the code.
  services/prover/test/rules.test.js
      The rule tests. Rewritten in #18 to drive the eight-signal circuit
      through the real request path; the recorded ground-truth fixtures they
      used to check against described the ten-signal Solana circuit and were
      removed with it.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
dr-wilson-empty/aip-beta — Copyright (c) 2026 Agent Internet Protocol — MIT

  packages/cli/
      The command-line client. src/core/wallet.ts keeps the scrypt and
      AES-256-GCM keystore unchanged from the Solana original; the key inside
      it is secp256k1 rather than Ed25519.
  packages/did-aip-driver/
      The Universal Resolver driver, carried over and rewritten to read
      ERC-8004.
  packages/a2a/
      The task protocol. Rewritten rather than copied, but derived from
      src/lib/protocol/: the JSON-RPC method names, the retry policy, the
      per-endpoint concurrency cap and the well-known cache all came from
      there.
  docs/did-aip/method-spec-v2.md
      Supersedes the v1 did:aip method specification.

